# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored; never commit a real key.
#
# The agent reads the key from the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY environment variable and
# nowhere else. The Makefile exports the contents of .env into the environment
# of the commands it runs; the code itself never opens this file.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional defaults (each can also be passed on the make command line).
# MODEL=claude-haiku-5-5
# POLICY_MODE=observe
